### Registro admin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@blog.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "name": "Super Admin",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Login admin

POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@blog.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

